			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "➵쏘㺷⿀늶⟦DEC0⟧뛝⿟룅꿅쿃봧㿖⟦DABA⟧糜㺽톽㺼⾶⟅눲⿄뎲쒺쌧뷞⻈",
